# name: push_to_wall
# description: push the ball to the wall using a lidar wall-goal + camera steering
# triggers: push to wall, lidar push, wall push, push using lidar, fusion push
#
# Strategy (lidar+camera fusion of ROLES):
#   - GOAL  = the wall behind the ball, from LIDAR (stable, doesn't jitter)
#   - STEER = keep the live ball centred, from the CAMERA
#   - DONE  = stalled near the wall-goal (ball pinned at the wall)
#   - if the ball escapes sideways, drive FORWARD to a standoff behind it
#     (the Create 3 can't reverse) and push again.

SET ball = SCAN_FOR("ball", 360)
IF ball != NONE THEN
    PRINT "Found the ball — pushing to the wall (lidar goal + camera steering)."
    SET r = PUSH_TO_WALL("ball")
    PRINT "Result:"
    PRINT r
ELSE
    PRINT "No ball found in the room."
END
